{"id":"id49Y-usDY","name":"RealEstateAPI","domain":"realestateapi.com","claimed":false,"description":"Access 159M+ U.S. property records via API. Property search, automated valuations, parcel boundaries, and address verification. Built for developers, trusted by enterprise.","longDescription":"RealEstateAPI provides real-time property intelligence through a developer-focused API serving software companies, enterprises, and businesses in proptech, fintech, risk management, and home services. Its data covers more than 159 million U.S. properties, with coverage across 95% of U.S. properties, and is cleaned, normalized, and structured for analytics and AI applications.\n\nThe platform offers property search, automated valuations, ownership information, parcel boundaries, map tools, and address verification. Developers can use its endpoints to build property reports, search experiences, map applications, and other data-driven products, or work with the company on custom API solutions. RealEstateAPI emphasizes reliable data, enterprise-grade performance, 99.9% uptime, and fast responses, alongside documentation, support, and implementation guidance.\n\nThe company also provides usage-based pricing, a free trial, and resources such as a blog, podcast, and help center. Its aim is to reduce the manual effort involved in collecting, cleaning, and maintaining property data, helping customers integrate useful information into their platforms and make informed decisions.","links":[{"name":"github","url":"https://github.com/realestateapi"},{"name":"instagram","url":"https://instagram.com/realestateapi"},{"name":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/realestateapi"},{"name":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/realestateapi"}],"banner":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/id49Y-usDY/w/1500/h/500/fallback/404/banner.webp?c=1bxidD1Ep0IvCs30PZ0R2&t=1793643315666","icon":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/id49Y-usDY/w/128/h/128/fallback/lettermark/icon.webp?c=1bxidD1Ep0IvCs30PZ0R2&t=17936433154